      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب خطر مشخصی برای بارداری ذکر نکرده یا داده کافی ندارد؛ فقط در صورت لزوم و با نظر پزشک.",
        "en": "Label states no clear risk or has limited data; use only if needed, under medical advice."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Limited available data with APTIOM use in pregnant women are insufficient to inform a drug-associated risk of adverse developmental outcomes.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-aptiom",
          "section": "8.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Eslicarbazepine is present in human milk.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-aptiom",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب برای کودکان شرط، محدودیت سنی یا نکته دارد؛ جمله برچسب در زیر آمده است.",
        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Safety and effectiveness of APTIOM have been established in the age groups 4 to 17 years.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-aptiom",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    "geriatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در سالمندان با احتیاط و معمولاً از دوز پایین شروع شود.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Although the pharmacokinetics of eslicarbazepine are not affected by age independently, dose selection should take in consideration the greater frequency of renal impairment and other concomitant medical conditions and drug therapies in the elderly patient.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-aptiom",
          "section": "8.5"
        }
      ]
    },
